[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 42242.47, "timestamp": "11:44:02", "text": "我認為櫻花區，雪區，我所在的地區，還好，那裡有櫻花。地點在花海附近。我不知道具體位置或距離有多近，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 42248.47, "timestamp": "11:44:08", "text": "但好像有一座紫色的塔，裡面"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 42251.906, "timestamp": "11:44:11", "text": "充滿了水晶。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 42267.426, "timestamp": "11:44:27", "text": "但我認為我可能找到了一頭黃色的牛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 42276.87, "timestamp": "11:44:36", "text": "就像一頭母牛，頭上長著向日葵或其他東西。是的。  是的。我把圖片轉過來了。那他媽是什麼玩意兒？你也這樣嗎？哦，我不"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 42285.148, "timestamp": "11:44:45", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "!uptime"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 42286.23, "timestamp": "11:44:46", "text": "明白。你試過擠奶嗎？我沒有。呃，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 42289.928, "timestamp": "11:44:49", "author": "@Fossabot", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Qae0Khsat_K9w3KLI_TUx-usVsmpNVDdoSaJjJqkO8yeQsjDwP1oZiwJ8s2cjd_lZ5HnnDuQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "@NINJA, Joq's Concert Plate, JoqniX has been live for 12 hours and 14 minutes"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 42295.71, "timestamp": "11:44:55", "text": "我應該這麼做的，我來的時候殺了很多。  等等，到底掉了什麼？普通的皮革和肉。是的。啊，那顯然是要"}]